## Decisions and Action Items

1. **Use Cases Draft Adoption**: The working group agreed to adopt the Agentic AI Use Cases and Requirements draft as a WG starting point. The authors will re-submit the document under the official working group draft name.
2. **Use Cases Document Restructuring**: Volunteers (Suhas Nandakumar, Leonel Mora, Jonathan Rosenberg, Jari Arkko, and Colin Jennings) will work with the draft authors to disentangle architectural assumptions from core requirements and better incorporate multi-modal, tool-calling, and human-in-the-loop requirements.
3. **Virtual Interims**: The chairs will establish a schedule for regular virtual interim meetings between IETF plenaries.

